HST Office: Range.Words / Range.Sentences, Range.Bold / Range.Italic, Selection.Words /
Selection.Sentences and Selection.ClearFormatting in Word VBA (owner request for beta.5, toward the
upstream TODO suites testWords / testSentences).

- SwVbaTextUnits can be limited to a range (the words or sentences of a Range or of the selection).
- Range.Bold / Range.Italic read and set the character weight / posture (True = -1 as in Word).
- Selection.ClearFormatting resets the direct character formatting (.uno:ResetAttributes).

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-vba.py (writer-range-words*, upstream suites).
